---
---

<section id="brand" class="py-24 bg-slate-950/60 border-y border-slate-900 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Info -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest block font-mono">Our Craftsmanship</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Space_Grotesk'] leading-tight">
          Bukan Sekadar Pakaian, <br/>
          <span class="accent-gradient">Ini Pernyataan Karakter.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Malega Apparel lahir dari eksplorasi desain streetwear kontemporer yang mengedepankan integritas material, siluet yang fungsional, serta kenyamanan maksimal dalam iklim tropis maupun gaya hidup aktif perkotaan.
        </p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1 font-['Space_Grotesk']">Heavyweight 300GSM</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Tekstur kain tebal, kokoh, tidak mudah kusut dan tetap breathable saat dikenakan.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1 font-['Space_Grotesk']">Boxy Drop Shoulder</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Pola jahitan presisi menciptakan siluet bahu tegas dan fitting yang proporsional.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1 font-['Space_Grotesk']">Anti-Bacterial Treatment</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Lapisan khusus pencegah bau untuk kesegaran optimal sepanjang hari.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3">
              04
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1 font-['Space_Grotesk']">Limited Batching</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Koleksi dirilis dalam kuantitas terbatas demi menjaga nilai eksklusif setiap artikel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Visual Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 to-slate-950 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400">MATERIAL STUDY</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Space_Grotesk']">Pure Organic Cotton</p>
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-orange-400">DURABILITY</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Space_Grotesk']">Reinforced Double Seam</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">COLORWAY</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Space_Grotesk']">High Reactive Dye</p>
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 to-slate-950 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">SILHOUETTE</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Space_Grotesk']">Urban Boxy Cut</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
